msgstr "Partial success: if a single record fails, that record is rolled back entirely, and the response returns the failure details in failures."

msgid "部分成功：单条记录失败只回滚该条；同名且同歌手的重复记录（与库中已有或同文件内前面已接受者比较，忽略顺序/大小写）计入 failures，其余正常入库。"
msgstr "Partial success: a failing record only rolls back that record; duplicate records with the same name and singer (compared against existing rows or earlier accepted ones in the same file, ignoring order/case) are counted in failures while the rest are stored normally."

