msgstr "Music UUID (Required, must already exist)"

msgid "音乐与其播放源的 RESTful 增删改查；音乐详情接口会同时返回其全部播放源。"
msgstr "RESTful CRUD for music and its playback sources; the music detail API also returns all of its playback sources."

msgid "音乐列表查询"
msgstr "Query Music List"

msgid "音乐名称"
msgstr "Music Name"

msgid "音乐名称（必填）"
msgstr "Music name (Required)"

msgid "音乐服务聚合两条线路：爱听音乐网（2t58）提供首页榜单、歌手、歌曲详情、播放链接与歌词、关键词搜索，适合直接搭建在线音乐搜索与播放页面；小影音乐是平台自有曲库，提供音乐与播放源的增删改查，以及 JSON 批量导入、导出。"
msgstr "The music service aggregates two channels: Aiting Music (2t58) provides home charts, singers, song details, playback links with lyrics, and keyword search, making it suitable for building an online music search and playback page; XiaoYing Music is the platform's own library, offering CRUD for music and its playback sources plus JSON bulk import and export."

msgid "音乐源接口,音乐API,免费音乐接口,歌曲搜索API,歌词接口"
msgstr "Music Source API,Music API,Free Music API,Song Search API,Lyrics API"

msgid "音乐聚合能力：爱听音乐网抓取（首页/歌手/歌曲/搜索）与小影音乐自有曲库的增删改查。当前接入 2 条线路。"
msgstr "Music aggregation: scraping Aiting Music (home/singer/song/search) plus CRUD for the XiaoYing Music library. 2 channels are currently integrated."

