msgstr "Page Number"

msgid "首页数据"
msgstr "Home Data"

# ==================== API 文档内容 · 抖音 ====================
msgid "5.89 dAT:/ ... https://v.douyin.com/xxxxx/ 复制此链接...\n或直接粘贴链接 / aweme_id"
msgstr "5.89 dAT:/ ... https://v.douyin.com/xxxxx/ copy this link...\nOr paste the link / aweme_id directly"

msgid "7622798120358923583"
msgstr "7622798120358923583"

msgid "一级纯文本评论内容"
msgstr "Plain-text top-level comment"

msgid "两条线路均需项目签名。抖音的风控参数全部由服务端处理：视频解析走匿名 ttwid 加重试策略，评论发布在服务端补环境执行抖音官方 JS 生成所需签名，调用方既不需要浏览器，也不需要自行实现签名算法。"
msgstr "Both channels require project signature authentication. All Douyin anti-bot parameters are handled server-side: video parsing uses an anonymous ttwid plus a retry strategy, and comment publishing runs Douyin's official JS in a patched environment on the server to generate the required signature. Callers need neither a browser nor their own implementation of the signing algorithm."

msgid "发布抖音评论"
msgstr "Publish Douyin Comment"

msgid "在指定视频下发布一条一级纯文本评论，返回评论 ID、内容与发布时间。"
msgstr "Publish a plain-text top-level comment under the given video and return the comment ID, content and publish time."

msgid "在指定视频下发布一级纯文本评论，需携带真实抖音登录 Cookie。"
msgstr "Publish a plain-text top-level comment under the given video; a real Douyin login Cookie is required."

msgid "必填：抖音登录 Cookie 完整字符串（含 sessionid 等）。仅透传给抖音，服务端不落盘；Cookie 失效会返回外部服务错误。"
msgstr "Required: the full Douyin login Cookie string (including sessionid and so on). It is only passed through to Douyin and never stored by the server; an invalid Cookie returns an external-service error."

msgid "必填：支持三种输入 —— ①完整分享文本 ②链接（v.douyin.com 短链 或 www.douyin.com/video/xxx）③纯数字 aweme_id"
msgstr "Required: three input formats are supported — ① the full share text ② a link (v.douyin.com short link or www.douyin.com/video/xxx) ③ a numeric-only aweme_id"

msgid "必填：目标视频 ID，纯数字，取自视频页 URL 的 /video/<aweme_id> 部分。"
msgstr "Required: target video ID, digits only, taken from the /video/<aweme_id> part of the video page URL."

msgid "必填：评论内容。当前仅支持一级纯文本评论，不支持 @ / 话题 / 图片。"
msgstr "Required: comment content. Only plain-text top-level comments are supported; @ mentions, topics and images are not."

msgid "把抖音分享内容解析为可直接下载的视频/图文数据。"
msgstr "Parse Douyin share content into directly downloadable video / image & text post data."

msgid "抖音"
msgstr "Douyin"

msgid "抖音API,抖音视频解析,抖音去水印,抖音图文解析"
msgstr "Douyin API,Douyin Video Parser,Douyin Watermark Remover,Douyin Image Post Parser"

msgid "抖音分享文本"
msgstr "Douyin Share Text"

msgid "抖音平台能力聚合：视频/图文解析（无水印提取）与评论自动发布（纯服务端签名，无需浏览器）。"
msgstr "Douyin capabilities in one place: video/image post parsing (watermark-free extraction) and automated comment publishing (server-side signing only, no browser needed)."

msgid "抖音服务提供两类能力：视频 / 图文解析——传入分享链接即可拿到无水印的视频或图集地址等信息；评论发布——在指定视频下发布一条一级纯文本评论。"
msgstr "The Douyin service offers two capabilities: video / image-post parsing, where a share link is all it takes to get the watermark-free video or gallery URLs and related information; and comment publishing, which posts a plain-text top-level comment under a given video."

msgid "抖音登录 Cookie"
msgstr "Douyin Login Cookie"

msgid "抖音视频/图文解析"
msgstr "Douyin video / image & text post parsing"

msgid "抖音评论发布"
msgstr "Douyin Comment Publishing"

msgid "抖音风控严格：高频调用会导致账号被限流，请低频调用并对失败做退避。"
msgstr "Douyin enforces strict risk control: frequent calls will rate-limit the account, so call at a low frequency and back off on failures."

msgid "浏览器登录抖音后，从开发者工具「网络」面板复制完整 Cookie"
msgstr "Log in to Douyin in a browser, then copy the full Cookie from the Network panel of the developer tools"

msgid "短视频解析能力，提取无水印视频/图文内容。当前接入抖音线路，后续可继续扩展平台。"
msgstr "Short video parsing that extracts watermark-free video / image & text post content. The Douyin channel is currently integrated; more platforms can be added later."

msgid "被风控拦截时抖音返回空响应，此处统一映射为「外部API调用失败」。"
msgstr "When blocked by risk control Douyin returns an empty response, which is mapped uniformly to an external API call failure."

msgid "视频 ID"
msgstr "Video ID"

msgid "视频解析"
msgstr "Video Parsing"

msgid "解析抖音内容"
msgstr "Parse Douyin Content"

msgid "解析抖音视频或图文，返回无水印地址等信息。"
msgstr "Parse a Douyin video or image & text post and return the watermark-free URL and other information."

msgid "评论发布"
msgstr "Comment Publishing"

msgid "评论接口风控较严，建议低频调用并对失败做退避重试，避免短时间内对同一视频重复提交。"
msgstr "The comment endpoint is subject to strict anti-bot controls: keep the call rate low and back off on failures, and avoid re-submitting to the same video within a short window."

msgid "请使用真实可访问的分享内容测试；解析失败返回外部服务错误。"
msgstr "Test with real, accessible share content; a failed parse is reported as an external service error."

msgid "请求体为 application/x-www-form-urlencoded 表单。"
msgstr "The request body is an application/x-www-form-urlencoded form."

msgid "请求体为 application/x-www-form-urlencoded 表单；参数放表单字段，不要放 URL 查询串。"
msgstr "The request body is an application/x-www-form-urlencoded form; put parameters in form fields, not in the URL query string."

msgid "需先准备真实抖音登录 Cookie，且该账号有权限评论目标视频（视频需存在且公开）。"
msgstr "Prepare a real Douyin login Cookie first, and make sure that account may comment on the target video (the video must exist and be public)."

