msgstr "r2 (Cloudflare R2)"

msgid "scdn 线路支持上传本地图片或传入远程图片 URL，服务端按内容 SHA-256 秒传——同一张图片重复上传会直接返回已有链接，不会额外占用容量；picui 线路附带服务端 Token 池管理，可查看各 Token 的已用与剩余容量，并支持批量补充 Token。"
msgstr "The scdn channel accepts a local image or a remote image URL, and the server de-duplicates by SHA-256 content hash, so uploading the same image again returns the existing link without consuming extra capacity. The picui channel adds server-side Token-pool management: view used and remaining capacity per Token, and top up Tokens in bulk."

msgid "scdn.io 图床"
msgstr "scdn.io Image Host"

msgid "scdn.io（img.scdn.io）图片托管"
msgstr "scdn.io (img.scdn.io) image hosting"

msgid "telegram"
msgstr "telegram"

msgid "token_file 为按行存放 Token 的文本文件（一行一个），可与 tokens 同时使用。"
msgstr "token_file is a text file with one Token per line; it can be used together with tokens."

msgid "tokens 支持重复字段、逗号或换行分隔，一次可提交多个 Token；Token 内不能含空格等空白字符（文件里若带注释/多余列会被拒绝，避免导入无效 Token）。"
msgstr "tokens supports repeated fields and comma- or newline-separated values, so several Tokens can be submitted at once; Tokens must not contain whitespace such as spaces (files with comments or extra columns are rejected to avoid importing invalid Tokens)."

msgid "total_capacity_bytes / total_used_bytes / total_remaining_bytes：与上面三项一一对应的字节值，便于程序精确计算"
msgstr "total_capacity_bytes / total_used_bytes / total_remaining_bytes: byte values corresponding one-to-one to the three fields above, for precise computation in code"

msgid "total_capacity_mb：全部 Token 的总容量合计（MB）"
msgstr "total_capacity_mb: total capacity of all Tokens (MB)"

msgid "total_remaining_mb：全部 Token 的剩余容量合计（MB）—— 即系统当前还能上传的总容量，看这个字段判断是否要补货"
msgstr "total_remaining_mb: total remaining capacity of all Tokens (MB) — how much you can still upload; use this field to decide whether to restock"

msgid "total_used_mb：全部 Token 的已用容量合计（MB）"
msgstr "total_used_mb: total used capacity of all Tokens (MB)"

msgid "true（加密上传）"
msgstr "true (encrypted upload)"

msgid "webp"
msgstr "webp"

msgid "webp_animated（动图）"
msgstr "webp_animated (animated)"

