msgstr "Up to 1000 Tokens per import; this service requires a project signature (app_id/timestamp/nonce/sign)."

msgid "可重复传参，或用逗号、换行分隔一次提交多个"
msgstr "Repeatable; or separate several values with commas or newlines to submit them at once"

