msgstr "Business ID"

msgid "两者都不传时：用平台 .env 的密钥走 key 模式；平台未配置则返回 20011/40001。"
msgstr "When neither is provided, the platform .env key is used in key mode; if the platform is not configured, 20011/40001 is returned."

msgid "代理 IP 服务把多个渠道聚合成一套统一接口：66 免费代理、青雨动态代理与住宅长效、巨量代理 IP、91HTTP 动态代理、静态代理管理与 Thordata 动态住宅代理，调用方按需选择线路即可，不必分别对接各平台的协议与参数。"
msgstr "The proxy IP service aggregates multiple providers behind one unified API: 66 free proxies, Qingyu dynamic proxies and long-lived residential nodes, Juliuliang proxy IPs, 91HTTP dynamic proxies, static proxy management, and Thordata dynamic residential proxies. Pick the channel you need instead of integrating each provider's protocol and parameters separately."

msgid "代理IP API,免费代理IP接口,动态代理IP,住宅代理API,静态代理IP,HTTP代理接口"
msgstr "Proxy IP API,Free Proxy IP API,Dynamic Proxy IP,Residential Proxy API,Static Proxy IP,HTTP Proxy API"

msgid "代理协议"
msgstr "Proxy Protocol"

msgid "代理密码"
msgstr "Proxy Password"

msgid "代理源"
msgstr "Proxy Source"

msgid "代理账号"
msgstr "Proxy Username"

msgid "住宅长效节点由青雨侧提取得到一组固定连接信息（主机/端口/账号/密码），节点带到期时间、到期需重新提取，故返回的是可直接使用的代理地址而非 IP 列表。连接信息可由调用方传入（使用自己购买的节点），不传则用平台 .env 配置；verify=true 会真实经代理发一次请求。"
msgstr "Residential long-lived nodes are extracted from Qingyu as a fixed set of connection info (host/port/username/password). A node has an expiry time and must be re-extracted after it expires, so this returns a ready-to-use proxy address instead of an IP list. The connection info can be provided by the caller (using their own purchased node); if omitted, the platform .env configuration is used. verify=true sends one real request through the proxy."

msgid "删除静态代理"
msgstr "Delete Static Proxy"

msgid "动态代理的有效期普遍很短（部分线路仅 1-3 分钟），住宅长效与静态代理更适合需要固定出口 IP 的业务。所有线路均需项目签名，部分线路的订单号 / 密钥支持调用时自行传入，以覆盖平台默认配置。"
msgstr "Dynamic proxies generally expire quickly (some channels last only 1-3 minutes), while long-lived residential and static proxies better suit workloads that need a stable egress IP. All channels require project signature authentication, and some accept your own order number or secret at call time to override the platform defaults."

msgid "动态短期代理，每次调用返回全新 IP；订单号/apikey 默认由平台侧持有，调用方也可传自己的 order/apikey 使用自己购买的订单。"
msgstr "Dynamic short-lived proxy; each call returns a brand-new IP. The order/apikey is held by the platform by default, and the caller may also pass their own order/apikey to use their own purchased order."

msgid "协议类型"
msgstr "Protocol Type"

msgid "向 JSON 文件新增一条静态代理。"
msgstr "Add a static proxy to the JSON file."

msgid "地区筛选"
msgstr "Region Filter"

msgid "多源代理 IP 聚合：66 免费代理、青雨动态代理与住宅长效、巨量代理 IP、91HTTP 动态代理、静态代理管理与 Thordata 动态住宅代理，支持可用性验证。"
msgstr "Multi-source Proxy IP aggregation: 66 Free Proxy, Qingyu dynamic proxy and residential long-lived proxy, Juliang Proxy IP, 91HTTP dynamic proxy, Static proxy management, and Thordata dynamic residential proxy, with Availability check support."

msgid "如 1.2.3.4"
msgstr "e.g. 1.2.3.4"

msgid "如 1483587531995538"
msgstr "e.g. 1483587531995538"

msgid "如 183.131.35.91"
msgstr "e.g. 183.131.35.91"

