msgid "data.groups 含地区 / 题材 / 语言 / 年份 / 排序五组，value 回传给「列表」接口的同名参数。"
msgstr "data.groups holds five groups — region, genre, language, year and sort order; pass value back to the list endpoint as the same-named parameter."

msgid "sid / nid 越界或源站无有效地址时返回 40001。"
msgstr "Returns 40001 when sid / nid are out of range or the source site has no valid URL."

msgid "一次返回首页全部推荐区块，便于直接渲染站点首页。"
msgstr "Returns all home recommendation blocks in one call, ready to render the site home page."

msgid "关键 ID 有固定的传递顺序：分类接口返回的 id 传给列表接口的 type_id，列表中的 id 传给详情接口的 vod_id，详情中的 sid / nid 再传给播放接口取地址，串起来就是一条完整的播放流程。"
msgstr "Key IDs follow a fixed order: the id returned by the categories API goes to the list API's type_id, an item's id goes to the detail API's vod_id, and the sid / nid from the detail response go to the playback API. Chaining them yields a complete playback flow."

msgid "分类 ID"
msgstr "Category ID"

msgid "分类列表"
msgstr "Category List"

msgid "可选：按地区筛选，如 大陆（取值见「筛选条件」接口的 area 组）。"
msgstr "Optional: filter by region, e.g. 大陆 (values come from the area group of the filters endpoint)."

msgid "可选：按年份筛选，如 2026（取值见「筛选条件」接口的 year 组）。"
msgstr "Optional: filter by year, e.g. 2026 (values come from the year group of the filters endpoint)."

msgid "可选：按语言筛选，如 国语（取值见「筛选条件」接口的 lang 组）。"
msgstr "Optional: filter by language, e.g. 国语 (values come from the lang group of the filters endpoint)."

msgid "可选：按题材筛选，如 动作（取值见「筛选条件」接口的 genre 组）。"
msgstr "Optional: filter by genre, e.g. 动作 (values come from the genre group of the filters endpoint)."

msgid "可选：排序方式 time/hits/score。"
msgstr "Optional: sort order time / hits / score."

msgid "可选：页码，从 1 开始，默认 1。"
msgstr "Optional: page number, starting from 1, default 1."

msgid "各分类的可用值不同（例如动漫有「日本 / 欧美」，综艺有「真人秀 / 脱口秀」），年份还会随站点上新自动增加，建议由本接口动态渲染筛选栏，不要在客户端写死。"
msgstr "Available values differ per category (anime offers Japan / Europe & America, variety offers Reality Show / Talk Show, and so on), and the year list grows as the site adds titles. Render the filter bar from this endpoint instead of hard-coding values in the client."

msgid "地区"
msgstr "Region"

msgid "地区 / 题材 / 语言 / 年份 / 排序可任意组合，源站按交集返回；组合后没有匹配影片时 data.items 为空数组，不会报错。"
msgstr "Region / genre / language / year / sort can be combined freely and the source site returns the intersection. When a combination matches nothing, data.items is an empty array rather than an error."

msgid "实时爬取源站并缓存。数据类（片名/详情/集数）缓存较久，播放地址（m3u8）缓存较短以便及时刷新。"
msgstr "Crawls the source site in real time and caches the results. Data (titles / details / episode counts) is cached longer, while playback URLs (m3u8) are cached briefly so they stay fresh."

msgid "年份"
msgstr "Year"

msgid "影片 ID"
msgstr "Movie ID"

msgid "影片不存在时返回 40001。"
msgstr "Returns 40001 when the movie does not exist."

msgid "影片详情"
msgstr "Movie Details"

msgid "必填：分类 ID（见「分类列表」接口），如 1=电影 2=连续剧。"
msgstr "Required: category ID (see the category list endpoint), e.g. 1=Movies 2=TV Series."

msgid "必填：分类 ID，1=电影 2=连续剧 3=综艺纪录 4=动漫 124=福利 126=擦边短剧（子分类见「分类列表」接口的 sub）。"
msgstr "Required: category ID — 1=Movies 2=TV Series 3=Variety & Documentary 4=Anime 124=Premium 126=Short Dramas (sub-categories come from sub in the category list endpoint)."

msgid "必填：影片 ID（取自列表/搜索结果中的 id）。"
msgstr "Required: movie ID (from the id field in list / search results)."

msgid "必填：搜索关键词（片名）。"
msgstr "Required: search keyword (title)."

msgid "必填：播放源序号，取自详情接口 sources[].sid。"
msgstr "Required: playback source index, from sources[].sid in the detail response."

msgid "必填：集数序号，取自选集 episodes[].nid（电影通常为 1）。"
msgstr "Required: episode index, from episodes[].nid (usually 1 for movies)."

msgid "按人气"
msgstr "By Popularity"

msgid "按关键词搜索影片。"
msgstr "Search movies by keyword."

msgid "按分类获取影片列表，支持分页、排序与年份 / 地区 / 题材 / 语言组合筛选。"
msgstr "Get a movie list by category, with pagination, sorting, and combined year / region / genre / language filters."

msgid "按时间"
msgstr "By Time"

msgid "按评分"
msgstr "By Rating"

msgid "排序方式"
msgstr "Sort By"

msgid "搜索影片"
msgstr "Search Movies"

msgid "播放地址"
msgstr "Playback URL"

msgid "播放源序号"
msgstr "Source Index"

msgid "数据类信息（片名、简介、集数等）缓存时间较长；播放地址（m3u8）因为带时效只做较短缓存，请勿在客户端长期缓存播放地址。本服务需项目签名。"
msgstr "Metadata such as title, synopsis and episode count is cached for a long time, while playback URLs (m3u8) expire and are cached only briefly, so do not cache playback URLs on the client for long. This service requires project signature authentication."

msgid "源站地址直出，不做代理转发。"
msgstr "The source URL is returned directly without proxying."

msgid "用于搭建站点导航：main 为主分类，sub 为连续剧的子分类，返回的 id 都可直接传给「列表」接口的 type_id。"
msgstr "Use it to build site navigation: main holds the primary categories and sub holds the TV-series sub-categories; every returned id can be passed to the list endpoint as type_id."

msgid "电影"
msgstr "Movies"

msgid "电影API,影视API接口,免费电影接口,m3u8播放地址,影视解析API,影片搜索接口"
msgstr "Movie API,Video Streaming API,Free Movie API,m3u8 Playback URL,Movie Parser API,Movie Search API"

msgid "电影服务聚合影视站数据，提供分类、筛选条件、首页推荐、列表、详情、选集与播放地址（m3u8）等完整链路，按「分类 → 列表 → 详情 → 播放地址」的顺序即可搭起一个影视站，搜索接口则支持按片名关键词查片。"
msgstr "The movie service aggregates data from a film and TV site and provides the full chain of categories, filters, home recommendations, lists, details, episode lists and playback URLs (m3u8). Following \"category, list, detail, playback URL\" is enough to build a movie site, and the search endpoint looks titles up by keyword."

msgid "电影聚合服务：提供影视的分类、列表、详情、选集与播放地址（m3u8）能力，按「列表 → 详情 → 播放」流程即可搭建完整影视站。"
msgstr "Movie aggregation service: categories, lists, details, episode lists, and playback URLs (m3u8) for films and TV shows — build a complete streaming site with the \"list → detail → play\" flow."

msgid "筛选条件"
msgstr "Filters"

msgid "获取可用分类（主分类 / 子分类 / 专题）。"
msgstr "Get available categories (main categories / sub-categories / specials)."

msgid "获取影片详情：简介、导演/演员等元数据、播放源与选集列表。"
msgstr "Get movie details: synopsis, director / cast metadata, playback sources, and episode lists."

msgid "获取指定播放源/集数的 m3u8 播放地址。"
msgstr "Get the m3u8 playback URL for a given playback source and episode."

msgid "获取某分类可用的筛选条件：子分类、地区、题材、语言、年份、排序。"
msgstr "Get the filters available for a category: sub-categories, region, genre, language, year, and sort order."

msgid "获取首页聚合数据：轮播图与各推荐区块（本周/本月最佳、各榜单等）。"
msgstr "Get home feed data: the carousel and all recommendation blocks (best of the week / month, rankings, and more)."

msgid "语言"
msgstr "Language"

msgid "返回 data.items（影片列表）与 data.pagination（分页信息）。"
msgstr "Returns data.items (movie list) and data.pagination (pagination info)."

msgid "返回 data.m3u8 为可播放地址；该地址带时效，已做较短缓存（默认 30 分钟）。"
msgstr "data.m3u8 is a playable URL; it is time-limited, so it is cached only briefly (30 minutes by default)."

msgid "返回 data.results 影片列表，字段与列表接口一致。"
msgstr "Returns data.results (movie list) with the same fields as the list endpoint."

msgid "返回 data.sources（播放源），每个源含 episodes（选集），选集里的 sid/nid 用于「播放地址」接口。"
msgstr "Returns data.sources (playback sources); each source contains episodes, whose sid / nid are used by the playback URL endpoint."

msgid "返回 data.sub_types（子分类，value 回传给 type_id）与 data.groups。"
msgstr "Returns data.sub_types (sub-categories; pass value back as type_id) and data.groups."

msgid "集数序号"
msgstr "Episode Index"

msgid "页面下方提供在线播放器：请求成功后自动加载播放，也可粘贴任意 m3u8 地址测试。"
msgstr "An online player is provided below: it auto-plays after a successful request, and you can also paste any m3u8 URL to test."

msgid "题材"
msgstr "Genre"

msgid "首页聚合"
msgstr "Home Feed"

msgid "默认"
msgstr "Default"

