msgid "调用链：请求 model → 查模型记录 → 取所属厂商的地址与密钥 → 按 OpenAI 兼容协议调用上游。因此新增一个模型只要在这里加一条记录，不用改代码、不用重启。"
msgstr "Request flow: the model parameter → its model record → that vendor's base URL and API key → the upstream call over the OpenAI-compatible protocol. Adding a model therefore only means adding a record here — no code change, no restart."

msgid "地址填到版本段为止（如 https://api.deepseek.com 或 https://api.moonshot.cn/v1），本服务会在其后拼 /chat/completions。"
msgstr "Enter the base URL up to the version segment (e.g. https://api.deepseek.com or https://api.moonshot.cn/v1); /chat/completions is appended automatically."

msgid "密钥以 AES-256-GCM 密文落库，页面只显示掩码、永不回显原文；密钥由 SECRET_KEY 派生加密，更换 SECRET_KEY 会导致已存密钥无法解密。"
msgstr "Keys are stored as AES-256-GCM ciphertext; the page only ever shows a masked hint, never the plaintext. Encryption is derived from SECRET_KEY, so changing SECRET_KEY makes stored keys undecryptable."

msgid "模型标识就是请求参数 model 的取值，也是对外唯一标识；对外接口不会暴露厂商标识与上游地址。"
msgstr "The model key is the value of the model request parameter and the only public identifier; vendor codes and upstream URLs are never exposed to callers."

msgid "「支持视觉」决定该模型能否带 images 参数；未勾选时传图片会返回参数值非法（20003）。"
msgstr "\"Vision\" decides whether the model accepts the images parameter; when unticked, passing images returns an invalid-value error (20003)."

msgid "默认模型：请求不传 model 时使用，全局应保持恰好一个；没有默认模型时不传 model 会报错。"
msgstr "Default model: used when a request omits model. Keep exactly one globally; with none set, requests without model fail with a clear error."

