msgid "采样参数（温度 / 最大回复长度 / 停止词）按模型配置，留空即不下发该参数；调用方无法自定义，请求里带了会被拒绝。"
msgstr "Sampling parameters (temperature / max reply length / stop words) are configured per model; leaving one blank means it is not sent. Callers cannot override them — passing one is rejected."

