msgid "超级管理员,开发者联系方式,联系方式平台"
msgstr "superadmin,developer contacts,contact platforms"

msgid "小影API 超级管理员：维护开发者联系方式的平台字典（渠道、填写项、跳转链接模板）与各接入项目的联系方式，展示在对应项目的反馈页与公开区。"
msgstr "XiaoYingAPI superadmin: maintain the developer-contact platform dictionary (channels, field labels, link templates) and each connected project's contact values, shown on that project's feedback page and public area."

msgid "维护联系方式平台字典与各接入项目的具体值；这些内容展示在对应项目的反馈页与公开区底部。"
msgstr "Maintain the contact-platform dictionary and each connected project's contact values; they appear at the bottom of the corresponding project's feedback page and public area."

msgid "还没有联系方式平台，点右上角「新增平台」建一个。"
msgstr "No contact platform yet — use “Add platform” in the top-right corner to create one."

