msgid "用你自己的海角社区账号（用户ID + Token）直接发帖：选择板块与标签、填写标题正文、上传图片与视频，一键发布。"
msgstr "Post directly with your own Haijiao Community account (user ID + token): pick a board and tags, write the title and body, upload images and videos, then publish in one click."

msgid "标签池按创建时间倒序、每页 20 条且不支持搜索，可直接用上面的输入框添加自定义标签（源站会把不存在的标签当作新标签）。"
msgstr "The tag pool is ordered newest-first, 20 per page, with no search — use the input above to add custom tags (the source site treats unknown tags as new ones)."

msgid "支持撤销 / 重做与常用排版；粘贴时会自动清理外部样式，避免源站排版错乱。内容会自动暂存在本机，刷新不丢。"
msgstr "Supports undo / redo and common formatting; pasted content is stripped of foreign styles so the source site layout does not break. Drafts are saved locally and survive a refresh."

msgid "缩略图左上角为发布顺序；右键（触屏点右上角 ⋯）可查看信息 / 上移 / 下移 / 删除。"
msgstr "The number at the top-left of each thumbnail is the publish order; right-click (or tap ⋯ on touch screens) to view info / move up / move down / delete."

msgid "源站对所有新帖走人工审核：提交成功后会提示「待审核」，审核通过后才对外可见；被驳回会给出原因，可在下方「我的帖子」查看。"
msgstr "The source site manually reviews every new post: after submitting you will see “pending review” and it becomes public only once approved; if rejected, the reason appears under “My posts” below."

msgid "源站有发帖频率风控，短时间重复发帖会被拒绝（提示灌水），请控制节奏。"
msgstr "The source site rate-limits posting; posting repeatedly in a short window is rejected as spam, so pace yourself."

msgid "图片支持 png / jpg / jpeg / gif / bmp（单张 ≤10MB），视频仅支持 mp4。"
msgstr "Images support png / jpg / jpeg / gif / bmp (up to 10 MB each); videos support mp4 only."

msgid "图片与视频需先上传成功再插入正文，未插入正文的上传不会被发布。"
msgstr "Images and videos must be uploaded first and then inserted into the body; uploads that never make it into the body are not published."

msgid "媒体不占正文，发布时按顺序附在正文末尾；源站限制：视频一次只能 1 个，图片最多 20 张、单张 ≤10MB。"
msgstr "Media does not count as body text; it is appended to the end of the body in order. Source-site limits: one video per post, up to 20 images, 10 MB each."

msgid "发帖必须带海角登录态：在自己的账号页或浏览器存储里取到 user id 与 token 后填入即可，服务端不落库。"
msgstr "Posting requires a Haijiao login: copy the user ID and token from your account page or browser storage into the form — the server never stores them."

msgid "本页通过服务端代签调用本站接口，密钥只在发起请求时使用，不落库。还没有接入项目？请先注册并在控制台创建。"
msgstr "This page calls our API with server-side signing; the secret is used only while the request is sent and is never stored. No project yet? Register first and create one in the console."

msgid "请输入标题（≤36 字）"
msgstr "Enter a title (up to 36 characters)"


